--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -60,3 +60,21 @@ Marks all unread notifications as read.
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `PATCH /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Updates the notification settings of the current user.
+
+Notifications are bundled into time windows and emailed as a single digest when a window closes. The window opens when the first notification lands, and `bundle_email_frequency` sets how long it stays open: `never` (no emails), `every_few_hours`, `daily`, or `weekly`.
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "bundle_email_frequency": "daily"
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
